0/MISC and both now start.DOC/DEPENDS lists, per program, every absolute path its binarycarries -- read it before copying single commands elsewhere.See DOC/REBUILT-NOTES.md for four curated binaries that wereoverwritten during installation and what was done about each.------------------------------------------------------/dd/CMDS -- added utilities (283)------------------------------------------------------  X11R6shl       X11R6 shared library loader  ape            APE - text filter *aprocs         process monitor  arc            ARC 5.21 archive utility  areacode       look up a US telephone area code *as09           6809 assembler  assembler      GSHELL front-end for the assembler *autolf         auto-linefeed filter  banner         print large banner text  basicwin       X11 demo - basic window (needs an X server) *bm             bm - fast grep utility (Boyer-Moore)  bmgtest        Boyer-Moore-Gosper substring search demo  bmgtest2       Boyer-Moore-Gosper substring search demo (variant)  bootgen        generate an OS-9 boot file  buildhash      build ispell's dictionary hash (writes LIB/ispell.hash)  bush           draw a random bush/tree *cal            calendar  calen          calendar printer (v_misc)  calendar       reminder service - reads a calendar file  calender       print a whole year's calendar (German)  casefix        normalise letter case in a text file *cb             C beautifier  cdiff          context diff  chardef        define a character set *chbase         change module base *checkenv       check env var  checksum       file checksum *chgrp          change group  chksum         32-bit file checksum *chown          change owner *ci             RCS check in  cjpeg.070      JPEG compressor (68070 build) *ckermit        C-Kermit (cio build)  clock          display a clock  cls            clear the screen (termcap) *co             RCS check out  compiler       GSHELL front-end for the C compiler  